   "type": "stat",
   "title": "Worker lag",
   "description": "Messages on pr.enriched the worker has not committed. Same expression as the TriageWorkerLagging alert, which fires above 20 for 5 minutes. Derived from the raw gauges because consumer_group_lag_sum reads 0 when the worker is dead.",
